          "description": "A weekly measure of Ethereum futures open interest and trader positioning reported by the CFTC's Traders in Financial Futures report. The data separates Ethereum futures positions into Dealer/Intermediary, Asset Manager/Institutional, Leveraged Funds, Other Reportables, and Nonreportables, with long, short, spreading, and net exposure measures where applicable. Each Ethereum futures contract represents 50 ETH.",
